# Drop the registrar signature image here as `registrar_signature.{png,jpg,jpeg,svg}`.
# The admission letter (applicant-side printAdmissionLetter, student-side
# AdmissionLetterController::show, and registrar-side generateLetter)
# picks up whichever file exists at this path automatically — no need to
# go through /registrar/admission-letter/settings.
#
# If the registrar also uploads via the settings form, that file lands
# here too, and the upload form's path row (system_settings.
# registrar_signature_path) takes priority over this fixed-file
# fallback.